    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamita siguura Maana ea udamughuushta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eada eemeesean bea Israeli ng'eanyiida Elimu, ak geeweay ea eehita dareapcheeda Sini, mida dageascheeda Elimu ea Sinayi, nea eaweedeaba damanamuut gil bea sheedeaba iyeenya aba damanda ghayi rinna Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaadaghuut eemeesean bea Israeli Musa ea Haruni aba jeeda dareapcheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha saawa, “Ghang'wana ghayi gwanuuseasa NG'UTAMIIDA aba ng'eanyiida Misri, damanda siipiitpiidi ak geayaaji banyeega ea mukaate ea eelang'uuda, mwasamwa gideaba gooyeadu eemeeni ghabwar jalooda aba jeeda dareapcheeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Ng'ula, gaydanung' gwaroobaseegwa roopta mukaate jea gwaleabu humng'eeda, ak gaygwarita buuneeda gaweay jarooda galeagasean ghoawaam daghwardeaba eaweecheanjagi ak gaydasim saawa dadaa ea jea ghoang'waay deaweedeanyu ghana manda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedeaba lah bea giliwas eawooji ispwa siitiing'diing'deawa gida jea eeyeadu gah, gajea nibiyeenya gil aba gea siiwaam galeagasean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Musa ea Haruni ak gwayeesha fuga sean bea Israeli, “Shing'ada gajanala gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi gooruunaneegwa ng'eanyiida Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak numuji sakteayda gajadaaha giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba niyiiy gideaniiksiindi NG'UTAMIIDA. Aseasa geawooschi ng'eaha inyas gooniikseasaan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Shing'ada gaygagooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA banyeega jea ayaaga, ak sakteayda gaygagooneegwa mukaateeyda jea goolang'uudeegwa, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA niyiiy giiniikghteang'wa ooniiksi niny, aseasa geawooschi ng'eaha? Giiniikghteang'wa mamiiseasa, gammiisa NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha Haruni “Eeshiina eemeesean bea Israeli, gideaba, ‘Apkaani aneekiisiina madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba niyiiy giiniikghteang'wa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda duu goobaloola Haruni eemeeda fuga Israeli, hean siing'weersa dareapcheeda, hean geadaah nirdu giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda shamooghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naayiinyi giiniikghta fuga Israeli, eeshiina saawa, ‘Shing'ada gajayaaga banyeega, ak sakteayda gajayaaga mukaate, ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niiw shing'ada ghapka udamughuushta ea gwadukuta maheemajeanda, nea sakteayda ea nineaweesa rahooda murdajeega sean bea maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu nea ghoabit rahooda, geepuussa ng'eanyi dugusu manang'i uurji mukaate asasi aba jeeda dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah fuga Israeli duguugiga, gaba nih eesha nuut, “Suh naaha?” Aba gideaba meanali gidawas. Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha saawa, “Suh mukaateeyda gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA gil jea ayaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih diigheanda ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil gideaba ‘Gilinyoo ea siida gil dealiima gidabeachi daghwardaanyi jea ghwaak beachi jeeda dahuuda nea geegala mooneeda fuga mida jeeda maheemajeanda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasindunu fuga Israeli, suuk gooliim gea naawda, nea suuk ghoawaam gea suunyaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geeteen aba gidida siiteeniida siguura hoomeeriin, siidida gwachi awaam gea naawdaan ea manda gidabit nea dea awaam gea ng'ay ea manda gidashoay, gaba nih awaam giteena daghwardaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha saawa, “Adiidu ghwalach giliwas siida hamidi ea ghoah sakteayda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda siisi aleeysiit Musa, fiisu ng'ay ghwalach gidak ea ghoah sakteayda, ak iidu ea niimealu aba gideaba ning'ut ghuughuutka, hean ghwanyareas Musa aba badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa gilinyoo ea sakteayda gil gaba siisi awaam gidabeachi daghwardaanyi jea ghwaak, ak iidagu daknooda ghwanyar hamitida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedeaba lah bea jeemba eawooji ispwa, inyeesa geeweamu mukaateeydida nibiyeenya, gaba nih anyiit gidida hoomeeriin nibiyeenya, hean gaweay fuga hees bea eemeeda Israeli gwarukusa Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha saawa, “Nih gidarugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil gideaba, ‘Numuji Sabaato gil. Ak ea eaweeda fuufta gil nea ghoabwachi gheawungeasu. Abeasha gea jea abeasha, ak ghoawali gea jea eawaala, ak gea jea ghwalagaan sean ootiiwa ea ghoah sakteayda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geetiiw ea ghoah sakteayda gawuurji gidarukusiinda Musa saawa, ak ea mii goomealu aba gideaba miighang'ut ghuughuutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha, “Eanean ayaaga aba gideaba eanean Sabaatoheeda NG'UTAMIIDA gil, aba gideaba eanean hamidi mwajanyasa aba jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajoawaamwa eawooji lah, ama eaweedeaba ispwa ea mwajanyasa aba gideaba eaweeda Sabaatohi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedeaba ispwa gaweay fiisu ng'ay jarooda ghoawaam ak ea mwanyasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Gajaheawana eang'waanya diigheanyeekeasu ea deaweedajeegeasu ea ghoah eeju? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula! NG'UTAMIIDA nigooneegwa Sabaato, ak eawooji lah gagooneegwa mukaateeyba eawooji iyeenya, asi daba siisi abiida heeda mida gilinyoo ea siida gil deabiidana ghoah eaweeda Sabaato nea adagagadiiyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gafuuf buuneeda eaweeda Sabaato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguura fuga Israeli hamitida Maana, iing'ulayi gawuurji bukushiida nea iisamu gwasamu mukaateeyda siyeasha maleeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha, “Nih diigheanda ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil, gideaba, ‘Ootiiwa bayokchanjagi, ghapka ghwadaah jeacheengeagwa mukaateeyda ghayi aang'aataawaneegwa aba dareapcheeda, damanda earuunaneegwa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha Haruni, “Geani maghasta ak giyiini jeeda maanaheeda deena jeemba hoomeereenagi, ak giyiini madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghwahita damanda jeacheengeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasinda Haruni gidida rukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musahiin, ak gageanu ghwayiin madeeda meeseedida bea muuwuunoodean eetiiw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli ghwaak maana gweanyeew haradam, ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida jea goobiida, ghwaak maana ea ghwahita moonghooda ng'eanyiida Ganaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Homerajeanjagi geegala bayookcheew damanamughuush).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
